- **Date**: November 27, 2024.  
- **Pickup Time**: 5:00 PM (17:00 in 24-hour format).  
- **Estimated Details**: ~15-20 km distance, 20-30 minute ride (depending on traffic). Expect standard taxi rates (~CAD 40-60; confirm with provider). No special requirements noted, but mention if you have luggage or group size.

I can't complete the actual booking here (requires payment/details), but you can use a service like Uber, local taxi apps (e.g., Taxi Coop de Québec), or the airport's pre-booked options. Search results show availability in the area—book soon for November peak. If you provide more info (e.g., number of passengers, vehicle type), I can refine this!

